<title>SRI LANKA: Hayleys 12-month net 47 pct up.</title>
<headline>Hayleys 12-month net 47 pct up.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Hayleys Photoprint Ltd, for the 12 months ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				1997	     1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	     282.95   vs    184.34</p>
<p>    Net profit	     5.72   vs	3.89</p>
<p>    Tax			4.41   vs	3.35</p>
<p>NOTE - Hayleys Photoprint which imports and distributes photographic and printing material, is a subsidiary of Hayleys Ltd.</p>
</text>
